  "description": "Internal operational block/query only. All dates location date-only, intervals[start,end), end omitted/null is infinity. Availability is advisory at checkedAt and does not reserve. Inspection is never available. No mark-ready/archive or booking acceptance/check-in API yet. Active physical presence remains a blocker independently of allocation end. Block creation/release audited atomically with allocation; restricted SaaS does not prevent managing existing operational obligations.",
